<title>UK: Eurotunnel Q4 turnover down but up on year.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel Q4 turnover down but up on year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurotunnel Plc said on Friday that the Channel tunnel fire in November 1996 affected fourth quarter turnover.</p>
<p>Turnover in the fourth quarter of 1996 slipped to 85.96 million stg from 112.79 million in the comparative period. However, annual turnover at the Channel tunnel operator increased to 448.05 million stg from 298.59 million in 1995.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
